  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Views from private finance stakeholders on delivery of British International Investment&#x2019;s current strategy and future options</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study to collect data from Private Finance Stakeholders including major institutional investors, and key financial institutions on delivery of British International Investment&#x2019;s (BII) 2022 - 2026 Strategy. Insights will inform focal areas for BII to work with and mobilise private finance for impact in the next strategy period.</narrative>
  </description>
